        <p>AND 10 PRIZES OF 10s. EACH.</p>
        <p>The following verses are given not as a sample of what can be dons in the competition, but to show the rhythm of the verses to any who may be un- acquainted with them.</p>
        <p>Five verses should end with "My Mother" and one with " Why Boote,".or some similarly suitable syllables.</p>
        <p>Who, when the Spring came would direct Her efforts, e'en by pa unchecked, Boots stains to use with grand effect? My mother 1</p>
