        <p>EARLESTOWN V WIGAN.—Playe,l at Earlestown on Satur- day. The feature of the game was the bowling by Alderson, who cuatured three of the Wigan wickets In four balls, and the utter collapse of the Earlestowa batting. The only °layer or. the home side to enter double figures was Husband. The others, with the exception of Crowther, were unable to withstand the Wigan bowliug, and they were all out in the short space of an hour. Score : W/G.IX. EARLESTOWN. Halliwell b Davies 1 T Marsh h Goodwin —o W F Goodwin o Jeukinson G Husband b Smith 21 b Alderson l6 11111nr b G00dwin..........- 2 H G Rushton b Alderson 6 ft A Robinson a Goodwin Prestt 1 Davies o E Hayden b Alderson ... 14 W H Crowther not out 8 G C Roger b Davies ..... 4 Jll Alderson b Smith S Ball b Alderson F Allan b Alderson 4 W Itylanae b Smith 0 J A Baldwin b Alderson ... 1 C W Emmett c Prestt b It L Rennlck not out l9 Smith Smith b alderson H Gilman b Goodwin o' Extras 4 Extras 2l</p>
